      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is a growing number of Internet based programs on pain management. Many of them offer continuing medical education credits (CMEs). \"Pain Management: The Online Series\" from the American Medical Association (AMA) is a recent addition. Its content is robust but the self-assessments tests needed to obtain CME are weak."},
